[I] Multiplayer action game

[T] Koules is a fast action arcade game for up to five players in which the
[T] player controls a ball and must push enemy balls (koules) out of the
[T] playfield. It runs under X11 and features sound, many levels and a
[T] deathmatch mode.

[U] https://sourceforge.net/projects/koules/

[A] Jan Hubicka
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/game
[F] NOPARALLEL FCOMMON

[L] OpenSource
[V] 1.4

[D] 2c8bdb23d5d298e4b3dde0fe3e73351778e572f0633bb1feb3fafab8 koules1.4-src.tar.gz http://www.ucw.cz/~hubicka/koules/packages/

runconf=0
hook_add premake 5 "ln -s xkoules.6 xkoules.man"

var_append makeopt ' ' "KOULESDIR=/\$SDECFG_PKG_GAMES_BINDIR \
			SOUNDDIR=/\$prefix/share/\$pkg \
			MANDIR=\$mandir/man6"
makeinstopt="$makeopt"' DESTDIR="$root" install'
